{"case": "RAG013", "raw_answer": "The passage concerning mirrors appears in Chapter XVIII of Dracula, written by Bram Stoker. Specifically, it states:\n\n\"He throw no shadow; he makes in the mirror no reflection,\" referring to Count Dracula. \n\nCount Dracula is described as someone who cannot cast a shadow nor produce a reflection in a mirror, unlike normal humans. This unusual trait is noted by Jonathan Harker during his stay with Count Dracul.", "raw_verdict": "SUPPORTED", "source_pages": [null, null, null, null, null, null, null], "profile": {"llm_calls": [{"input_tokens": 439, "generated_tokens": 54, "max_new_tokens": 400, "generation_ms": 13945.101400000112, "tokens_per_second": 3.8723275257073113}, {"input_tokens": 2343, "generated_tokens": 19, "max_new_tokens": 160, "generation_ms": 4352.586900000006, "tokens_per_second": 4.365220140693796}, {"input_tokens": 5818, "generated_tokens": 87, "max_new_tokens": 320, "generation_ms": 18992.476700000225, "tokens_per_second": 4.580761181083822}], "queue_ms": 0.002499999936844688, "structured_tokenizer_setup_ms": 2.4803999999676307, "structured_tokenizer_setup_calls": 2, "intent_ms": 13960.01920000026, "intent_calls": 1, "context_ms": 12.488800000028277, "context_calls": 1, "validator_ms": 4370.970300000408, "validator_calls": 1, "prompt_ms": 0.08040000011533266, "prompt_calls": 1, "total_ms": 37629.99190000028}}
{"case": "RAG019", "raw_answer": "During his first journey, the Time Traveller experienced several significant changes:\n\n1. He traveled approximately 8 days into the distant past, experiencing days unlike any humans had previously lived.\n   \n2. He endured extreme physical suffering, including exhaustion, hunger, and possibly exposure to harsh conditions.\n\n3. Upon returning, he was visibly altered physically and emotionally:\n   - His coat was dusty and dirty, and his hair was disordered and faded.\n   - He had a pale, ghastly face with a healed cut on his chin.\n   \u2013 His expression was haggard and drawn due to intense suffering.\n   -- He had developed a noticeable limp similar to someone who had been walking barefoot for extended periods.\n\nNo explicit details are given regarding the contents of the Time Machine or any specimens/photographs brought back, though it is mentioned that he intended to share these with the group.", "raw_verdict": "SUPPORTED", "source_pages": [null, null, null, null, null, null, null], "profile": {"llm_calls": [{"input_tokens": 443, "generated_tokens": 66, "max_new_tokens": 400, "generation_ms": 15360.77320000004, "tokens_per_second": 4.296658712466364}, {"input_tokens": 5083, "generated_tokens": 179, "max_new_tokens": 320, "generation_ms": 32959.40539999992, "tokens_per_second": 5.430923216836928}], "queue_ms": 0.0036999999792897142, "structured_tokenizer_setup_ms": 2.390099999956874, "structured_tokenizer_setup_calls": 1, "intent_ms": 15377.567999999883, "intent_calls": 1, "context_ms": 8.054299999912473, "context_calls": 1, "prompt_ms": 0.04540000009001233, "prompt_calls": 1, "total_ms": 48627.11249999984}}
